WEBVTT

NOTE
Cactuar - 1000 Needles. Iconic green cactus summon, fixed 10000 damage.
Observed duration in reference video: ~16 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Cactuar. 1000 Needles.

00:02.500 --> 00:07.000
A small green cactus with stubby arms and a frozen smile dashes into view.

00:07.000 --> 00:11.000
It scampers in zigzag bursts across the field, leaving a trail of dust.

00:11.000 --> 00:15.000
Cactuar plants its feet, rears back, and fires a thousand white needles outward.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.000
The needles rain down. Cactuar bolts away.
